      "kind": "narrative",
      "text": "I’d choose the business-class award via Los Angeles and Istanbul that arrives in Bangkok at 4:15 a.m. on January 10: among these shown choices, it keeps the same reported Turkish-program points as the later-arriving business option while getting in earlier. The tradeoff is an early arrival and a separately booked SFO–LAX segment; that connection is not verified as protected.",
